# Vercel falls back to .gitignore when this file is absent, and the repo
# gitignores the bear photos (they are explore.org's, kept out of git on
# purpose). This file exists so that fallback does not happen: the photos are
# uploaded from the deploying machine without ever entering git history.
#
# See web/public/bears/README.md and scripts/fetch-bear-photos.py.

node_modules
dist
.env
.env.local
*.log
